1
00:00:03,022 --> 00:00:04,460
The Big Bang made

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,470
almost nothing but hydrogen

3
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,403
and helium.

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,946
Everything else was built

5
00:00:09,946 --> 00:00:10,994
inside stars.

6
00:00:11,641 --> 00:00:13,422
They fuse hydrogen into

7
00:00:13,422 --> 00:00:15,478
helium, helium into carbon

8
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:17,361
and oxygen, and heavier

9
00:00:17,361 --> 00:00:18,799
atoms all the way

10
00:00:18,799 --> 00:00:19,833
up to iron.

11
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,146
But fusing iron costs

12
00:00:22,146 --> 00:00:23,985
energy instead of making

13
00:00:23,985 --> 00:00:25,513
it. In under a

14
00:00:25,513 --> 00:00:27,669
second, the core collapses.

15
00:00:28,315 --> 00:00:30,082
And the star explodes.

16
00:00:31,715 --> 00:00:33,828
That blast scatters carbon,

17
00:00:33,828 --> 00:00:35,552
oxygen and iron across

18
00:00:35,552 --> 00:00:36,098
space.

19
00:00:36,744 --> 00:00:38,685
Billions of years later,

20
00:00:38,685 --> 00:00:40,295
that dust formed new

21
00:00:40,295 --> 00:00:42,381
stars, planets, and you.

22
00:00:43,028 --> 00:00:45,141
Apart from hydrogen, nearly

23
00:00:45,141 --> 00:00:46,636
every atom in your

24
00:00:46,636 --> 00:00:48,015
body was made in

25
00:00:48,015 --> 00:00:48,561
stars.
